{
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.Button1": "Yes"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.Button2": "No"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.ErrorInvalidHistorySelection": "ERROR: Invalid history selection, something broke."
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.You'veAlwaysHadKnack": "You've always had a knack for games of chance. You took good advantage of that and spent your life gambling and betting, ending up with a sizable fortune. Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouAlwaysFeelLucky": "You always feel lucky when it comes to fortune. Because of that, you have always managed to save up gems until whatever's needed and how to make the most out it (+15% gems on victory). You will also start out with 250 gems. Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouAreMoreResistant": "[pg]You are more resistant to lust (+15% lust resistance), you can sate your lusts by killing lesser demons, and each demon killed increases your damage (+1% per kill, up to 50%). You cannot masturbate, however, and straying from your path will cause your god given strength to vanish! Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouManagedFindWork": "You managed to find work as a whore. Because of your time spent trading seduction for profit, you're more effective at teasing (+15% tease damage). Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouManagedGetApprenticeship": "You managed to get an apprenticeship with the local blacksmith. Because of your time spent at the blacksmith's side, you've learned how to fit armor for maximum protection. Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouManagedSpendMost": "You managed to spend most of your time having sex. Quite simply, when it came to sex, you were the village bicycle - everyone got a ride. Because of this, your body is a bit more resistant to penetrative stretching, and has a higher upper limit on what exactly can be inserted. Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouOftenSpentYour": "You often spent your free time with the village healer, learning how to tend to wounds. Healing items and effects are 20% more effective. Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouSpentLotTime": "You spent a lot of time at the village temple, and learned how to meditate. The 'masturbation' option is replaced with 'meditate' when corruption is at or below 66. Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouSpentLotTimeSlacking": "You spent a lot of time slacking, avoiding work, and otherwise making a nuisance of yourself. Your efforts at slacking have made you quite adept at resting, and your fatigue comes back 20% faster. Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouSpentMostYour": "You spent most of your time on the streets, picking pockets and breaking into houses. You've gotten pretty good at finding valuable targets and escaping from danger unharmed. Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouSpentMostYourTime": "You spent most of your time having sex, always finding different lovers to support you, often several at once. You've held onto most of your good looks and remained flexible despite your age. Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouSpentMuchYour": "You spent much of your time in school, and even begged the richest man in town to let you read some of his books. You are much better at focusing, and spellcasting uses 20% less fatigue. Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouSpentMuchYourTime": "You spent much of your time fighting other children, and you had plans to find work as a guard when you grew up. You do 10% more damage with physical attacks. You will also start out with 50 gems. Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouSpentMuchYourYouth": "You spent much of your youth fighting, which led to a life working as a guard. You're skilled in combat and managed to keep your body in good shape despite your age. Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouSpentSomeTime": "You spent some time as an alchemist's assistant, and alchemical items always seem to be more reactive in your hands. Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouStartedWhoringYoung": "You started whoring at a young age, and eventually found yourself managing the village's brothel. You're an expert at seduction, and you've managed to earn quite a bit of money from the business. Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouWereDevoutMonk": "You were a devout monk, spending most of your life in the temple. Meditation comes naturally to you, and you find little difficulty in resisting temptation and corruption. Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouWereMasterBlacksmith": "You were a master blacksmith, able to forge all manner of weapons and armor. Your experience allows you to improve and maintain your gear to get maximum effectiveness out of it. Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouWereTheMost": "You were the most skilled thief around, and even to this day you've never been caught. Nobody can match you when it comes to finding valuable targets and escaping from danger unharmed. Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouWereTheVillage": "You were the village healer, devoting your life to caring for the sick and injured. Thanks to your skills you've managed to remain especially healthy despite your age, and you can use healing items and abilities more effectively. Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouWereTrainedFrom": "You were trained from birth to fight with holy purpose and smite all corruption from the land!"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YouWorkedAlchemistFor": "You worked as an alchemist for many years, mastering a variety of different potions and learning to draw out the full potential of your ingredients. Is this your history?"
  "CharCreation.ConfirmHistory.YourLifeWasDedicated": "Your life was dedicated to both learning as much as possible and sharing your knowledge with others. You find it easy to understand the mysteries of magic, and you learn quickly from your experiences. Is this your history?"
}
